| New commands to check the status of the cluster:                                  |
| ------------------------------------------------                                  |
| [31mcnodes(B[m           : to list the status of all nodes                                |
| [31mcnodes -f(B[m        : to check for free nodes                                        |
| [31mcheckjob <jobid>(B[m : to check the status of your job (especially when not running ! |
| [31mshowstart <jobid>(B[m: to check when your job is expected to start when not running ! |
| [31mcdjob <jobid>(B[m    : to move to the <jobid> directory                               |
| [31mcdtmp <jobid>(B[m    : to move to the <jobid> working directory on node               |
| [31mrmtmp <jobid>(B[m    : removing the <jobid> working directory on node                 |
